{title: Kanmani Anbodu}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Kamal Hassan S Janaki}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#]Kanmani [Fm]anbodu [D#m]kaadhalan,        [G#]Naan ezhuthum [C#]kaditha [G#]mae
[C#]Ponmani [Fm]un veetil [D#m]sowkiyama,        [G#]Naan ingu [C#]sowkiya [G#]me
[C#]Unnai enni paarkaiyil kavithai kottuthu
[C#]Athai ezhutha ninaikaiyil vaarthai muttuthu
[C#]Oh [D#m]ho...        [C#]Kanmani [Fm]anbodu [D#m]kaadhalan
[G#]Naan ezhuthum [C#]kaditha [G#]mae,        [C#]Undaana kaayamengum thannalae aaripona
[F#]Maayam enna [G#]ponmanae [C#]ponmanae
[C#]Enna kaayam aana pothum En meni thangi kollum
[F#]Unthan meni [G#]thaangaathu [C#]senthaenae,        [Fm]Enthan kaadhal ennavendru sollamal
Yenga yenga [D#m]azhugai vanthathu,        [Fm]Enthan sogam unnai thaakum
Endrennumbothu vantha [D#m]azhugai ninrathu,        [A#m]Manithar unarnthu kolla
[Fm]Ithu manitha kaadhal alla,        [A#m]Athaiyum thaandi punitha [C#]manathu
[C#]Abiraamiyae [Fm]Thaalaattum [D#m]Saamiyae,        [G#]Naanthaanae [C#]Theriyu [G#]maa?
[C#]Sivagamiyae [Fm]Sivanil Neeyum [D#m]Pathiyae,        [G#]Athuvum [C#]Unnakku Puriyu [G#]maa
[C#]Suba Laaliyae Laaliyae Laali Laaliyae,        [C#]Abiraami Laaliyae Laali Laaliyae.
[C#]Athuvum onnaku theriyu [F#]ma
